  "description": "A fully managed library for reading, writing and building Khronos glTF 2.0 3D models (.gltf and .glb) in .NET. It provides a complete glTF 2.0 document object model with support for the common KHR and EXT extensions, mesh, material and scene builders for authoring models, and runtime helpers that decode meshes, skins, morph targets and animations for renderers.",
